---
title: Pineapple Sweet Potatoes
author: Judy White
category: Veggies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@yams{6%large} (cooked and peeled) (or 8 small)
@brown sugar{1/2%c}
@lemon juice{3%Tbsp}
@crushed pineapple{1%9-oz can}
@shredded coconut{1/2%c}
@sugar{1%c}
@cornstarch{3%Tbsp}
@melted butter{1/3%c}
@chopped pecans{1/2%c}

Cut yams length wise in thirds and place in greased casserole dish. Heat together sugar and cornstarch in saucepan. Stir in lemon juice, butter and crushed pineapple. Bring mixture to a boil and cook 5 minutes. Pour sauce over yams, sprinkle coconut and pecans over yams. Bake 15-20 minutes at 350 degrees.
